# Engli stdlib: lists — collection helpers.
Export Define function length taking xs giving whole:
    Return len(xs).
End.
Export Define function first taking xs:
    Return xs at 0.
End.
Export Define function last taking xs:
    Return xs at (len(xs) minus 1).
End.
Export Define function total taking xs as list of number giving number:
    Return sum(xs).
End.
Export Define function largest taking xs as list of number giving number:
    Return max(xs).
End.
Export Define function smallest taking xs as list of number giving number:
    Return min(xs).
End.
Export Define function ordered taking xs:
    Return sorted(xs).
End.
Export Define function flipped taking xs:
    Return list(reversed(xs)).
End.
